  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I would like either the triangle limit for PC Excellent to be lowered, or the triangle limit for Mobile Poor to be raised.\n\nCurrently, even if you create an avatar that meets the PC Excellent triangle limit, uploading it for Mobile can cause it to be rated Very Poor because the triangle limits do not align.\n\nTherefore, I would like one of the following changes:\n\n・The PC Excellent triangle limit to be lowered to 20,000.\n\n・The Mobile Poor triangle limit to be raised to 32,000.\n\nThis would make it easier to create avatars that maintain consistent performance ranks across both PC and Mobile.\n\nPCのExcellentとMobileのPoorのポリゴン数を統一して欲しいCannyです。",
